---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator calls emergencyWithdraw(token, to, amount)
    q_check_auth --> q_error_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_transfer: caller is Legion operator
    q_transfer --> q_emit: transfer amount of token to address(to)
    q_emit --> [*]: emit EmergencyWithdraw(token, to, amount)

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: Emergency withdrawal bypasses normal state checks
        INV-002: Only Legion operators can execute (highest privilege)
        INV-003: Can withdraw any ERC20 token held by the contract
    end note
